# The sync server's JSON store, which it writes at the repo root
# (server/index.js: path.join(ROOT, "data")). Anchored with a leading slash:
# unanchored, `data/` matches a directory of that name at any depth and
# silently swallows `src/data/`, so new datasets there never get committed.
